0019:     output path (length L, 5-9) has 3 monotone phases (relative to bar's forward direction, i.e. away from border):
0020:       phase 1 (approach): 0+ diagonal-forward steps toward obstacle from root side (FL if root is left, FR if right)
0021:       phase 2 (alongside): 0+ straight-forward steps running alongside obstacle
0022:       phase 3 (exit): 0+ diagonal-forward steps away on the opposite side (FR if phase1 was FL, vice versa)
0023:       lengths of three phases roughly balanced (eval avg: ~ 2:1:2)
0024:     no backward or lateral steps; phase transitions are strictly monotone (no mixing)
0025:     segment does not pass through obstacle
