0034:     3. Draw output segment path (length L, 5-9) from bar terminal attach point with 3 monotone phases: diagonal-forward approach on root side (FL* or FR*, matching which side of bar the root is on), straight-forward alongside (F*), diagonal-forward exit on opposite side; lengths of three phases roughly balanced (eval avg: ~ 2:1:2); 
0035:     4. Place obstacle sprite (1-9 px, irregular shape) inside the concavity, touching the V apex on its inner side; grow from the apex inward; manhattan distance 2-6 from bar terminal
0036:     5. Build the output grid with bars, output segments, and obstacles
